{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】題目：粵艇南下情況</p><p>首批粵艇南下旅客抵達香港，經過幾天遊歷，他們的體驗感受如何？有哪些建議給香港政府？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>經民聯文體旅事務委員會聯席主席陸瀚民</p><p>深圳鴻洲國際遊艇會總經理葉潤年</p><p>深圳市休閑船艇協會執行會長滕文棟</p><p>香港遊艇業總會主席周基倫</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.302546+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:10.597479+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:10.597479+00:00","content_hash":"2abb27fca32568b4f4490c786ed958be95b4259f1c38fac94fe84412b5ffc860","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}